                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​The High Tones - another Sci-Fi 48hr Film Challenge. Made in 48hrs, plagued with technical problems. Came 3rd. Watch in HD."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_mdegg8xgta",
          "type": "video",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "source": "embed",
            "title": "Video",
            "aspect": "16:9",
            "background": false,
            "url": "https://vimeo.com/35545167"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_nk3gw8mp6e",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Another old scifi 48hr Challenge. This year we wanted to do Victorian Scifi. So we did. Quite badly. Came top 10 anyway :) ​"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_cb0chd6vxg",
          "type": "embed",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "embed": {
              "type": "url",
              "url": "https://player.vimeo.com/video/92002385?color=ff9933"
            },
            "title": "Embedded content",
            "aspect": "16:9",
            "height": 240
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_skecpfmvbb",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Annual indulgence in the Sci-fi London 48hr Film Challenge."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Last year was High Tones (http://vimeo.com/mroscar/hightones), which was placed 3rd by Guillermo Del Toro."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This year I was busy at Aspen Shortsfest with The Kármán Line (we won two awards!) but was determined to join in anyway. Tradition and all that."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "So this one isn't so much a 48hr challenge as an 8 hour one. Made with a few splendid folk also at the fest and done in five shots."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Also check out this entry by my former team in London (my erstwhile film family), this time directed by Kármán Line's producer Tiernan Hanby: https://vimeo.com/91932659"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_9wzx27rjf8",
          "type": "video",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
