          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Penultimate week of NYU. Got the chance to direct an off-the-cuff scene with Peter Deming, cinematographer of Mulholland Drive, I Heart Huckabees, Cabin In The Woods etc etc."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I feel this is a very serious and important piece of cinema attempting to confront an issue I know I barely understand."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Starring Kate Deming, Julien Léonard Fernandez & Emily Cheeger"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Peter's team were Mia Cioffi Henry​, Jono Chanin​, Laura Valladao​ & Faraday Okoro​."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "#fuckyeahnyu"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
